{"page":144,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:125","surah":6,"ayah":125,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَن يُرِدِ ٱللَّهُ أَن يَهْدِيَهُۥ يَشْرَحْ صَدْرَهُۥ لِلْإِسْلَـٰمِ ۖ وَمَن يُرِدْ أَن يُضِلَّهُۥ يَجْعَلْ صَدْرَهُۥ ضَيِّقًا حَرَجًا كَأَنَّمَا يَصَّعَّدُ فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يَجْعَلُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلرِّجْسَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When God wishes to guide someone, He opens their breast to islam; when He wishes to lead them astray, He closes and constricts their breast as if they were climbing up to the skies. That is how God makes the foulness of those who do not believe rebound against them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُرِدِ","en_gloss":"wants","transliteration":"yuridi","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَهْدِيَهُۥ","en_gloss":"He guides him ","transliteration":"yahdiyahu","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَشْرَحْ","en_gloss":"He expands","transliteration":"yashraḥ","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صَدْرَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his breast","transliteration":"ṣadrahu","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِلْإِسْلَـٰمِ ۖ","en_gloss":"to Islam","transliteration":"lil'is'lāmi","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُرِدْ","en_gloss":"He wants","transliteration":"yurid","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُضِلَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"He lets him go astray","transliteration":"yuḍillahu","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَجْعَلْ","en_gloss":"He makes","transliteration":"yajʿal","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":14,"ar":"صَدْرَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his breast","transliteration":"ṣadrahu","verse_key":"6:125"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ضَيِّ