a","verse_key":"6:127"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٢٧","en_gloss":"(127)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:127"}]},{"verse_key":"6:128","surah":6,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يَحْشُرُهُمْ جَمِيعًا يَـٰمَعْشَرَ ٱلْجِنِّ قَدِ ٱسْتَكْثَرْتُم مِّنَ ٱلْإِنسِ ۖ وَقَالَ أَوْلِيَآؤُهُم مِّنَ ٱلْإِنسِ رَبَّنَا ٱسْتَمْتَعَ بَعْضُنَا بِبَعْضٍ وَبَلَغْنَآ أَجَلَنَا ٱلَّذِىٓ أَجَّلْتَ لَنَا ۚ قَالَ ٱلنَّارُ مَثْوَىٰكُمْ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۗ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ حَكِيمٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the day He gathers everyone together [saying], ‘Company of jinn! You have seduced a great many humans,’ their adherents among mankind will say, ‘Lord, we have profited from one another, but now we have reached the appointed time You decreed for us.’ He will say, ‘Your home is the Fire, and there you shall remain’- unless God wills otherwise: [Prophet], your Lord is all wise, all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"He will gather them","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَـٰمَعْشَرَ","en_gloss":"(and will say), \"O assembly","transliteration":"yāmaʿshara","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] jinn","transliteration":"l-jini","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَدِ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"qadi","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱسْتَكْثَرْتُم","en_gloss":"you have (misled) many","transliteration":"is'takthartum","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-insi","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And will say","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"6:128"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآؤُهُم","en_gloss":"thei